Name: allowspecialusesubfolder
Type: SWITCH
Default-Value: 0
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

If enabled, allows special-use folders anywhere in a user's namespace.

By default, only a direct child of a user's INBOX can have special-use,
however the attribute is set, and a special-use folder can't be moved
anywhere else.  This prevents clients renaming Sent to Trash/Sent, which
would confuse other clients.
